<title>JAPAN: Matsushita to brief media on finance unit.</title>
<headline>Matsushita to brief media on finance unit.</headline>
<dateline>OSAKA, Japan 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matsushita Electric Industrial Co Ltd said on Tuesday that it would hold a news conference concerning its finance subsidiary NL Finance at 4.30 p.m. (0730 GMT).</p>
<p>The company gave no further details.</p>
</text>
